hy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.45.05-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.45.05-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.45.05.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.40.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.40-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.40-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.40-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.40-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.40.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.25.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.25-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.25-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.25-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.25-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.38.25.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.25.59.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.25.59-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.25.59-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.25.59-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.25.59-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.25.59.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.20.59.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.20.59-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.20.59-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.20.59-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.20.59-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.20.59.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.17.29.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.17.29-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.17.29-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.17.29-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.17.29-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.17.29.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.16.52.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.16.52-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.16.52-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.16.52-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.16.52-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-12.16.52.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Leaving the park we drove on through the little town of Norris. \u00a0There were a lot of pictures in the museum of early days in Norris, when the TVA built the dam (1933-1936) and I&#8217;m guessing that&#8217;s how the town came to be, from all the workers employed while building the dam. \u00a0The pictures showed the &#8220;Norris Drug Store&#8221;, the &#8220;Norris Gas Station&#8221; and so on.<\/p>\n<p>It&#8217;s a cute little town, reminded me of the Andy Griffith show and Mayberry &#8211; everything clean and tidy. \u00a0Too bad I didn&#8217;t stop and get any pictures to share with you.<\/p>\n<p>Back at the park we&#8217;ve met 3 different couples. \u00a0Our new next door neighbors Jerry and Marsha from Florida on their way to Kentucky for an off-road event (see the pix of their rigs)<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3643\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3643\" style=\"width: 700px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.33.02.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3643 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.33.02-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.33.02-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.33.02-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.33.02-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.33.02.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3643\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">That&#8217;s an off-road buggy, a BMW motorcycle, AND a canoe under the buggy (that&#8217;s a spare tire for the buggy up front)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3642\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3642\" style=\"width: 700px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.46.33.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3642 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.46.33-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.46.33-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.46.33-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.46.33-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-29-16.46.33.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3642\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">450 hp diesel with the trailer attached measures 70&#8242; long! Four slides (two on each side) on the coach<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Then Kathy and I had a nice visit with Jon &amp; Cathy from Milford, OH on their way back home from Florida. \u00a0They are members of <a href=\"http:\/\/www.sower.org\/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">S.O.W.E.R.S.<\/a> (they volunteer their time working on various mission projects around the country).<\/p>\n<p>As I was taking the trash down to the dumpster, I met Karen and Lino, also from Ohio. \u00a0They are on their way back home from Florida where they had flown down one-way to purchase their new (used) 5th wheel trailer and pick-up truck.<\/p>\n<p>Karen has retired recently and Lino hopes to retire by the end of the year and then they&#8217;ll become full-time RV&#8217;ers and Karen may revive her home-based graphic arts and web design business working from the road.<\/p>\n<p>Although we&#8217;ve been blessed with seeing much of the country and that&#8217;s certainly a perk of this lifestyle, I think what&#8217;s even more of a blessing is having been given the opportunity to meet so many great people from all over the country.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Since we are spending two nights at Raccoon Valley RV Park at Heiskell, TN, we had today to do a little sightseeing. \u00a0We decided to check out Norris Dam State Park and if we were up to it after that we&#8217;d drive on in to Knoxville to see the Sunsphere tower adjacent to the Knoxville &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/29\/a-beautiful-day-in-a-beautiful-state-park\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">A Beautiful Day In A Beautiful State Park<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,18285,677,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707344,554707345,554707341,554707343,554707342],"class_list":["post-3610","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-equipment","category-friends","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-heiskell","tag-knoxville","tag-norris-dam","tag-raccoon-valley","tag-tennessee"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3610","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3610"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3610\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3645,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3610\/revisions\/3645"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3610"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=3610"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=3610"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}